  "description": "Core ST 2.0 Electric Bike for Adults is specially designed for urban commuting, offering a comfortable riding experience. It features a wide, comfortable saddle and handlebars to make your ride more easy and enjoyable. Powered by a peak 1200W motor and a 10.4Ah built-in lithium battery, it provides a range of up to 55 miles, so you don't have to worry about running out of power. The bike also comes equipped with a 7-speed gear system, allowing you to easily handle different road conditions and riding needs. Additionally, it is fitted with a powerful braking system to ensure your safety while riding. In summary, the Core ST 2.0 Electric Bike for Adults combines strong power, stability, comfort, and practicality—making it an ideal choice for your urban commuting needs.",
